WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.477
Here is a book label. The shelf code is zero four. How should the computer store it?

00:00:06.477 --> 00:00:13.183
Click Text. The code names a shelf. Storing it as text keeps the first zero.

00:00:13.183 --> 00:00:19.221
Click Check my work. When you practise, look at what each detail is used for.
